-- ENR-302 · time_allocation_reality · Every Site Visit and Installation Needs the Founder There

-- ENR-303 · founder_dependency · Customers and Suppliers Only Trust the Founder

-- ENR-304 · team_structure_role_clarity · Nobody Owns Whether the System Actually Performs After Handover

-- ENR-305 · decision_rights · Only the Founder Can Approve a Site Variation or a Warranty Repair

-- ENR-306 · hiring_repeatability · Installers Are Taken On Per Project With No Standard

-- ENR-307 · plan_to_vision_alignment · Taking Whatever Projects Come, With No View of the Business

